<title>RUSSIA: Russian Aug inflation slows to 37.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russian Aug inflation slows to 37.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's consumer price inflation slowed in August to a post-reform low of 37.1 percent year-on-year, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    AUG 96    JUL 96    AUG 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 -0.2	+0.7	+4.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +37.1     +43.6    +224.8</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
